   "lines": [
    "Rowed to Rye Beach",
    "and back. Perfectly",
    "calm but very hot.",
    "Started at[?] 5.15 ^a.m.^; Rocky",
    "Point 6.10; Oak Bluff",
    "6.40; Rye Beach 8.15.",
    "Started back 4.45",
    "p.m; Centre Island",
    "buoy[?] 6.15; home 7.15.",
    "In all I rowed",
    "rather over 25 miles.",
    "Saw a stormy petrel."
   ],
   "rows": null,
